     "html": "<p><b>DD</b> earliest due date · <b>FIFO</b> table order · <b>LIFO</b> reverse · <b>LOT</b> longest first · <b>SOT</b> shortest first.</p><p>For each rule: finish times, then lateness = max(0, finish − due). Compare the average time in process AND the average lateness.</p>"
