     "q": "A job finishes on day 9 and is due on day 6. Lateness?",
     "options": [
      "3",
      "0",
      "−3",
      "9"
     ],
     "right": 0,
     "why": "9 − 6 = 3. If it finished early it would be 0, never negative."
